  "foaf:name": "Study of Recent behavior of the Cyclones and Marine Heatwaves",
  "sdo:name": "Study of Recent behavior of the Cyclones and Marine Heatwaves",
  "sdo:description": "Considering the importance of the ongoing societal and sustainable development of Bangladesh and to reduce the vulnerability associated with Cyclones and their impact, an in-depth study entitled &quot;Study of Recent behavior of the Bay of Bengal Cyclones and their associated impact in Bangladesh&quot; has been taken into consideration.  An initiative will be taken to study the heatwave over the Bay of Bengal by using ERA5 datasets. In this aspect, dry and wet bulb temperature datasets of both observation and analyses will be collected for the study. It will also examine whether there is any relationship that prevails with the El Niño index.",
  "sdo:location": "Bangladesh",
  "sdo:identifier": "6",
  "sdo:url": "https://oceandecade.org/actions/study-of-recent-behaviour-of-cyclones-and-marine-heatwaves/",
